{% story GettingStartedWelcome with {
  name: 'Welcome',
} %}

<div class="container">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col d-flex justify-content-start">
      <img src="/components/foundation/images/assets/full-logo-dark.svg" height="32" alt="The Right Up logo" />
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="row mt-5">
    <div class="col">
      <h1>Welcome To The Right Up's Design System</h1>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row">
    <div class="col pt-3">
      <span class="h5">The Component Library for Our Editorial &amp; Media Experience</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="row mt-3">
    <div class="col">
      <p>This is the design system behind The Right Up: a library of reusable UI components &mdash; cards, media, navigation, and article layouts &mdash; built once and used consistently across the site. Browse it here to see every piece before it goes into a page.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row mt-5 pt-5">
    <div class="col pt-5 border-top border-light-subtle">
      <h2>How to Use It</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="row mt-3">
    <div class="col">
      <p>Each component lives in its own Storybook entry with all of its variants and controls, so you can see how it behaves before reusing it in a page. Start with the Foundation section for colors, typography, icons and logos, then browse Atoms, Molecules, and Organisms for the full UI library.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row mt-5 pt-5">
    <div class="col pt-5 border-top border-light-subtle">
      <h2>What’s Included?</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="row mt-3">
    <div class="col">
      <h3 class="mt-4">01 - Foundation</h3>
      <p>Guidelines on colors, typography, icons and logos.</p>

      <h3 class="mt-4">02 - UI Components</h3>
      <p>A library of ready-to-use components for building editorial pages.</p>

      <h3 class="mt-4">03 - Templates</h3>
      <p>Full page layouts assembled from those components.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row mt-5 pt-5">
    <div class="col pt-5 border-top border-light-subtle">
      <h2>Questions?</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="row mt-3">
    <div class="col">
      <p>Reach out to your development team for help extending or updating this design system.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% endstory %}

{% endstories %}
